OL,3,GNEWSATown centre transformation to
OL,4,Astart in new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a multimillion-pound
OL,7,Fredevelopment of Harrogate town centre
OL,8,Fis due to begin in the new year after
OL,9,Fcontractors were appointed by North
OL,10,FYorkshire Council.
OL,12,FThe Harrogate Station Gateway scheme,
OL,13,Faimed at improving access to the town's
OL,14,Frailway station for pedestrians,
OL,15,Fcyclists and bus passengers, was first
OL,16,Fannounced in 2022, but has since faced
OL,17,Fopposition.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
