OL,3,GNEWSATown centre transformation to
OL,4,Astart in new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome residents and businesses claimed
OL,7,Fthe end result would not justify the
OL,8,Fdisruption and expense, but the latest
OL,9,Flegal challenge to the plans was
OL,10,Frejected by the Court of Appeal in
OL,11,FMarch.
OL,13,FMalcolm Taylor, the council's executive
OL,14,Fmember for highways and transport, said
OL,15,Fthe scheme represented a "significant"
OL,16,Finvestment in the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
